FreeRADIUS dictionaries

radius-dictionary-freeradius bundles RADIUS dictionary files from the FreeRADIUS
Server project (https://freeradius.org/), copied unmodified from
https://github.com/FreeRADIUS/freeradius-server (share/dictionary/radius) at the
commit recorded in
radius-dictionary-freeradius/src/main/resources/io/radiusward/radius/dictionary/freeradius/SOURCE.properties.

    Copyright (C) The FreeRADIUS Server project and contributors
    Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
    (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Change made by radiusward: in the root file `dictionary`, the $INCLUDE line of
dictionary.ingate (which does not carry the CC BY 4.0 header and is therefore
not bundled) is commented out; the file header records this change.

Java sources generated from these dictionaries (attribute numbers and value
names) are marked "Derived from FreeRADIUS dictionaries (CC BY 4.0)".
